{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根大通：健策精密工业散热片含量增长</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>研究报告的核心判断并不复杂：健策（Jentech）未来两年盈利增长的主要来源，已经从单纯的出货量增长，切换为下一代AI芯片散热片单机价值量的跃升。报告将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>每股盈利预测分别上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>，理由是Rubin Ultra GPU的散热片设计变化可能带来2至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4倍</span>的内容增长。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数字。报告预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>第<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>营收为新台币<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">97亿元</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">33%</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">91%</span>。毛利率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">46.8%</span>提升至47.5%，而一年前这个数字只有39.0%。营收和毛利率同步走高的组合，说明增长不只是量的扩张，产品结构也在向AI芯片倾斜。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把这件事拆开看，Rubin Ultra GPU的散热片设计变化是整份报告最值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的细节。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>自今年1月起多次提及，下一代设计可能是“stiffener（加强件）+ disposable lid（一次性盖板）”的组合，封装测试过程中需要螺丝固定盖板，测试完成后由ODM厂商移除盖板和螺丝，再在芯片上方放置冷板。这个流程变化意味着每颗GPU的散热相关物料从一片式盖板变成多组件组合，单机价值量自然水涨船高。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX07ibAT2kPAtZ7IJFDL5y5FR1miasl0QmkcZ14GSvTHFBQU4UGibwFgianFkD7MZFlD4cqJhf0BtUf4RN5yt4tsq3gGcyFw8KYRgA/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. <span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>盈利<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span>来自散热片设计升级而非出货量</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告对<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>盈利预测保持不变，<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span>集中在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>每股盈利从新台币125.4元上调至129.0元，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>从189.1元上调至206.5元，上调幅度分别为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>和9%。营收预测同步调整，2027年从536亿元上调至551亿元，2028年从759亿元上调至825亿元。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">时间点值得留意。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>预测不动，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span>，说明报告认为Rubin Ultra的量产贡献要到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>才真正体现。这也解释了为什么报告对<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>年EPS的季度分布做了明显调整——从一季度22.34元逐步爬升至四季度45.08元，下半年贡献显著大于上半年。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028</span>年EPS<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span>幅度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>，这个数字比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>更值得琢磨。简单说，报告对远期产品设计的信心高于近期出货能见度；我更关注的是Rubin Ultra最终设计是否真的采用“stiffener + disposable lid”方案，一旦确认，后续还有进一步上修空间。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUro7bJcMUdUY5dHxKQtRDWy79cWIubtN3LyfuKB0rWUbVvoM9VXd8hsibhKI7RzfSC43aib4CZibPu41jKfHMFhpFTRTQAKf2R2g/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 毛利率持续走高的支撑来自AI芯片产品组合<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告预计毛利率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>的约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">41.6%</span>逐年提升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">51.8%</span>。这个判断建立在AI芯片收入占比持续上升的基础上。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">46.8%</span>已经比一年前的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">39.0%</span>高出近8个百分点，三季度预计继续走高至47.5%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">与市场共识对比，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>的毛利率预测明显更乐观。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>毛利率预测<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">51.8%</span>，比Bloomberg共识的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48.9%</span>高出295个基点。这组数字说明，分歧不在营收规模，而在产品组合<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>的速度和幅度。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告同时提到，AMD GPU和各家CSP的ASIC芯片散热片规格持续升级，也会支撑结构性增长。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUibQ7m5IrCBAfMVITHicg75BGFCMCAQod7BtA6o6FSyZWjGZcgs7b8ofnxrwNibkI2XIMhuVLUJbavWp6mFkmlWVzj6Pf8ncpZ9A/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWp3dltKq3icduh5SibSRNyd0lR7BAD46JvgjYcmgSlFNlSTnJpibYs85XDfiapQlZybZydriciaafenslrQMKgLnzOj38zMjAsNgpibw/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 54-JPM-Jentech Precision Industrial Co.-3653.TW- Stronger content growth- OW-260817</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
